WEBVTT

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:14.850
Whoa! Looks like the floor just switched itself completely invisible!

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.840
If you erase Layer Zero, it will sever every memory left by the Maker.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:43.300
If separate layers hide the story,

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:46.300
I will stitch all three panes together like a real bound book.

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:50.320
Watch closely, Thread Weaver.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:53.280
Now thread the needle right through the center.

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:06.850
Independent layers prevent accidents,

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:10.750
whereas physical stitches trap beauty in clumsy entanglement.

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.950
You cannot switch off real thread,

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:26.050
made by caring hands.

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:40.050
Your stubborn craft holds Layer Zero for today.

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:48.430
The Architect retreated straight into the Undo Labyrinth.
